  "ch8.say.ok": "It passes. The {seg} trace plus the fixed losses of package, slot and card come to {each} in total, against a budget of {bud}, leaving {m}. This material reaches {reach} at most.",
  "ch8.say.okret": "With {k} retimer(s), the trace is cut into segments of {seg} each, and each is checked against its own budget. The longest comes to {each}, within {bud}, leaving {m}.",
